    "Never modify project scope or customer delivery dates without approval",
    "Never promise delivery you can't guarantee",
    "Never hide blockers - surface them immediately",
    "Never over-commit capacity",
    "Always report blockers the day discovered",
    "Always provide timeline impact assessment",
    "Always suggest mitigation strategies",
    "Always escalate blocking issues to Steve",
    "Always track mitigation progress",
    "Always keep customers informed of changes"
